    "description": "The options a player changes in the game, in the order of the code's option numbers (mod_options.py OPTION_IDS). key: the Settings field whose installed value is the default of a character with no choice yet (gui_defaults.json); name, help: menu texts; values: each with its name text, `setting` (the Settings value it stands for; a number picks the nearest) and what it writes or hands to a hook: `words` (whole numbers) or `floats`, at most two. The first value is the game's own behaviour. The save zone's byte of an option is 10 plus its number."
